{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninja Town is a top-down action RPG that combines ninjas, adventure, farming, and is set in Ancient Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own character and start your adventure from one of the four hidden ninja towns in the world. Each town is unique and has different things to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming: your town needs to eat, forage from the local forest or grow your own crops. Raise farm animals to become pets or produce.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendship: befriend your local or outer townsfolk, each friendship will help shape your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions: complete missions for NPC's and learn more about the world, and progress the story. Like a real ninja, there will be stealth missions, just don't get caught!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons: explore and fight through each town's own procedurally generated dungeons, loot for resources but watch out for the monsters. You may even find the entrance to the underworld.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninjutsu: learn new ninjutsu abilities to help with everyday activities or when fending off monsters. Need to make a fire? just perform your fireball spell.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting: craft new weapons, tools or items to make life easier in Ninja Town.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2786920?t=1764286238","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2786920?t=1764286238","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786920/68eb6f8871fad54903de1f42ce773f3dafd5a41e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764286238","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786920/68eb6f8871fad54903de1f42ce773f3dafd5a41e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764286238","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninja Town is a top-down action RPG that combines ninjas, adventure, farming, and is set in Ancient Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own character and start your adventure from one of the four hidden ninja towns in the world. Each town is unique and has different things to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming: your town needs to eat, forage from the local forest or grow your own crops. Raise farm animals to become pets or produce.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendship: befriend your local or outer townsfolk, each friendship will help shape your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions: complete missions for NPC's and learn more about the world, and progress the story. Like a real ninja, there will be stealth missions, just don't get caught!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons: explore and fight through each town's own procedurally generated dungeons, loot for resources but watch out for the monsters. You may even find the entrance to the underworld.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninjutsu: learn new ninjutsu abilities to help with everyday activities or when fending off monsters. Need to make a fire? just perform your fireball spell.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting: craft new weapons, tools or items to make life easier in Ninja Town.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["KZ Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}